  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "At Tai Qiu, a desolate beast flying at high speed engages her. She does not fight it. She turns into a blurry green-grey bird, spreads her wings, and flies toward the teleportation traces, becoming the Gu Immortal closest to that spot. When Pi Shui Han blocks her, she does not evade. An Immortal Gu aura bursts out; the bird turns from blurry to clear, expands by thirty percent, and grows three golden peacock tails. Her speed rises and she flies past the first waves. She will not battle him and puts her effort into escaping; for a short time he can do nothing to her.",
      "chapters": [
        782
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "loc_tai_qiu",
        "sys_gu_immortal",
        "char_pi_shui_han",
        "sys_immortal_gu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "She turns into a blurry green-grey bird and spreads her wings. The bird turns from blurry to clear, expands by thirty percent, and grows three golden peacock tails on her back.",
      "chapters": [
        782
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "At Jade Pool blessed land, among the demonic path Gu Immortals attacking Dong Fang Chang Fan, she says that besides the blessed land there is still his wisdom path inheritance, the number one wisdom path inheritance in Northern Plains.",
      "chapters": [
        801
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "jade-pool-scramble",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "loc_jade_pool_blessed_land",
        "char_dong_fang_chang_fan",
        "reg_northern_plains"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "She is among those who encircle the area and seal escape routes.",
      "chapters": [
        802
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "jade-pool-scramble",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "When Dong Fang Chang Fan flees, she is in the first wave of the chase. Old Lord Can Yang later blocks Unfettered Scholar, Lu Qing Ming, and her.",
      "chapters": [
        804
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "jade-pool-scramble",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_old_lord_can_yang",
        "char_unfettered_scholar",
        "char_lu_qing_ming"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "At Iron Eagle blessed land she flies as a peacock, speaks in human language, and asks Zhuo Zhan to trade the desolate beast under his feet for a desolate beast shadowless horse she has just captured. He agrees.",
      "chapters": [
        1105
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "iron-eagle-scramble",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "loc_iron_eagle_blessed_land",
        "char_zhuo_zhan"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Iron crown eagles attract her because her next planned transformation is iron crown eagle transformation. As a desolate beast peacock she lures eagles and tries to pick them off one at a time.",
      "chapters": [
        1106
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "iron-eagle-scramble",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "She takes down four iron crown eagles, then sees Nu Er Gu and Guan Chou and quietly retreats from that stretch of sky. Later she fights three iron crown eagles in peacock form, is poisoned by Old Monster Corpse Poison, suppresses the poison, then loses control of her body when he blows at her from a distance.",
      "chapters": [
        1107
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "iron-eagle-scramble",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_nu_er_gu",
        "char_guan_chou",
        "char_old_monster_corpse_poison"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "A sword light interrupts him; she suppresses the poison and escapes.",
      "chapters": [
        1108
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "iron-eagle-scramble",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    }
  ],
